sequenceDiagram
    title UC14 发布编辑删除游记并审核——对象级顺序图
    participant P0 as 用户/管理员
    participant P1 as PostCreate.vue/AdminDashboard.vue
    participant P2 as PostController/AdminController
    participant P3 as PostServiceImpl
    participant P4 as SensitiveWordServiceImpl
    participant P5 as PostMapper
    P0->>P1: 提交游记或审核动作
    P1->>P2: POST /api/post/create 或 /admin/posts/{id}/approve
    P2->>P3: createPost()/条件审核
    P3->>P4: containsSensitiveWord()
    P4-->>P3: 返回检测结果
    P3->>P5: 保存待审或条件更新终态
    P5-->>P3: 返回状态
    P3-->>P2: 返回审核结果
    Note over P0,P5: 帖子仅允许 0待审→1通过/2拒绝；命中敏感词或越权编辑时拒绝。
